From b8345d22cb6989262b0b29bf3188469f9e61f5a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrian Vovk <adrianvovk@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Jun 2025 17:04:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 22/51] fail-whale: Drop

This doesn't work on Wayland, and gnome-session doesn't manage required
services anymore (thus: it won't launch the fail-whale anyways)

Fixes: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-session/-/issues/62
