From dac3c5f686b3ebc03efbedbea03b726fa2f313f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrian Vovk <adrianvovk@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Jun 2025 18:05:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 45/51] all: Drop handling of startup IDs

We don't actually use these for anything anymore: we just generate a
unique number each time they're set somewhere, and when apps report them
back to us we don't really do anything with them.

Let's drop the current handling, so that we can come up with something
new for when we implement modern session save/restore support.
